{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act23side_level_act23side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act23side",
  "stageId": "act23side_04",
  "title": "不念往昔",
  "storyCode": "WB-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f5fff83a355b36edb59b263dceda1d1c1f0e60ce200b75c9e81160e1963a1d03",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈掌柜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸欸，莫名其妙闯进来，转了一圈就走，那汉子到底是干什么的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "掌柜的，难道是巡防营的便衣，来看咱们有没有收留走私犯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈掌柜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你看他直直愣愣莽莽撞撞的样子，哪有那么扎眼的便衣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那就是来挑事的，我去把他抓回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈掌柜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你追得上吗？人家一眨眼就去了半箭地，明显会轻功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "刚才是最后一间客栈，没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个女娃说要出城，但也不在城门口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她伤重，用的都是最好的药，要是追不回来，医生保不齐把这笔钱算在我的头上，那还了得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一定要把她逮回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "鲤先生的比方，我有点听不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "只是个不恰当的例子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我在龙门开那一间小小的事务所，只为混口饭吃，没承想生意竟然不赖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "可见羽毛蒜皮、腌臜琐碎的事，总少不了，也不能事事都指望魏彦吾和近卫局来处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "总得有林先生这样的好市民来帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "这是无可奈何的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "是无可奈何......龙门如此，玉门也是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "玉门终年在北部边境巡航，是为了将种种危险拒于大炎国门之外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "可在早些年，源石技术还远没有发展到今天这个地步的时候，维系玉门这样一座移动要塞的正常运转，需要数倍的人力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "好在那个时候，有那么一批有志于为国效力的习武之人，主动奔赴玉门。他们没有正式加入军伍，但实际上帮玉门解决了不少后顾之忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "护送信使，勘探前路，甚至是与军队同赴战场......玉门百年安稳，离不开他们。这些武人在城中，自然也是受人敬重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "庙堂江湖，上下一心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "这是玉门曾经的样子......直到二十年前的一场意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "山海众？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "没错。同样是因为山海众。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "也没别的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "希望没有耽误平祟侯的公务。不然我有几个脑袋也不够砍的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "你明知道我不会同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一声短暂的鸣笛后，城楼的军用源石照明系统突然关闭，两人的对话断入黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只片刻工夫，摇曳的光明自远处亮起。\n军士们往来奔行，十步一岗，烽火次第传开。\n十七声鼓在此时擂响，又被高速移动的玉门城泼进夜色，在空气中拖出逶迤的长音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "今天是望烽节的第二天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "设立望烽节，是为了提醒玉门人铭记过往。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "这场见面，要么再早一些，要么再迟一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "那时候平祟侯应该已经想起了一些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "我从来没有忘记过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "平祟侯还记不记得，这些为玉门牺牲的英烈里，有多少并不是玉门的军士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "他们不欠玉门的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "玉门同样不亏欠任何人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "姓左的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡防营守军",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "退下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "二十年前，我的确疏忽大意，让那伙贼人乔装成玉门武人，混进城伤了百姓。你可以怨我，哪怕让我偿命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "但你要问罪，也只该问我，或者问你自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "一切罪责，当然由我一人承担。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "你是怎么承担的？这么多年来，疏远那些为玉门流过血汗的江湖兄弟，甚至要把他们通通逼走，就算你承担了吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "玉门要给他们一个交代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "玉门是大炎的玉门。它做的所有事，都是为了保亿万大炎百姓平安。这便是我的交代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左宣辽",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_788_1",
      "text": "请回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "“山海众”，不是人人都知道的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "也不能怪谁疏忽，当时只知道戒备外敌，并不知道暗处还有敌人想对玉门不利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "镖客、拳师、武器工匠......这些玉门武人常与守军并肩作战，当年在玉门城内也算往来自由。山海众恰恰利用了这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "城中缺少防备，各方面反应都慢了一步。虽然最终阻止了山海众破坏城市核心动力源的计划，但还是承受了不少伤亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "打那之后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "应该是亡兽补牢，为时不晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "不如说，“矫枉过正”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "打那之后，平祟侯开始对城中管理进行改制。一应事务不再依赖江湖人士，人员流动也多了不少限制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "还留在此地的人，有的投身军伍，有的收起刀，安心过普通百姓的日子。也许随便哪家客栈后厨的掌勺，当年就是名震一方的刀客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "二十年啊......够一个城市变几番面貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "爸也老是说，龙门总有一天，不会再有下城区，也不再需要鼠王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "如果有一天，这座城市不用永远在荒野上巡航，城中自然也无需人人带刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "时代终归会变的，有人想推一把，有人想拉一把。到最后，所有人都会被抛在后面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "text": "我听到的就是这样一段往事，也不知道能帮到雨霞姑娘多少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "......帮到了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_4080_lin_1",
      "text": "多谢鲤先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "你们打探清楚了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "还是十人队，一个时辰轮班的编制。沙渠那边没有额外的守军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "嗯，和我看到的一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "再托付你们一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "明晚酉时，在沙渠附近闹点动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "别太过火，引开巡逻队就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您这是要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "要是还信我，就别问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玉门武人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您刚才在城楼上，是见过左宣辽了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孟铁衣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_789_1",
      "text": "嗯，见过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "越来越热了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "昨晚有人行刺魏彦吾，把玉门军营弄得桃花乱飞，泥臭熏天。那个刺客，应该也是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "所到之处，气候如此反常，这是源石技艺，还是别的什么把戏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "截杀信使，抢夺天灾数据未果，便接连行刺朝廷要员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "山海众，究竟视玉门为何物？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "一座目的地错了的城而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "目的地错了，就不该再往前走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "你们知道玉门归国的目的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "不难猜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "父亲命我三日内办成三件事，追回宗师佩剑，抓捕刺客，找出潜藏在城内的山海众。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "想不到，都落在这小小的铸剑坊里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "恐怕你一件都办不成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "往后站，这人武功深不可测，我们不是对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "你没那个丰蹄汉子能打，反应倒是比他机灵一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "果然是你伤了太合先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "刚刚那一刀，你躲开了。那下一刀，是躲还是接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "既不躲，也不接。\n那人常跟她说，为了报仇也好，为了安身立命也好，习武，就要有徒步登高的打算。越是力有不逮，越是要坚定心志。\n既见仇敌，又见高山，所以自己在他身边待了整整五年。\n赢不了的仗，那就但求不输！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "以攻为守？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "也算有点胆识......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "但，你是不是想得太简单了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "武器相交的那一瞬，她才知道自己的决定有多轻率。\n她此刻面对的，竟然是另一座高山。\n寒光拂面，鼻尖撞碎了对方刀刃上的水珠，心跳清晰可闻。\n如果录武官在场，想必会惊呼仇白复现了演武场上那一招——\n俯冲，收势，在撞上死亡的弧光前及时折返，像是江面上险些被浪头打翻的羽兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "（闷哼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "这一刀，你又躲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "还想逞凶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "左乐，避！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "左乐被仇白拽住衣领急退。\n他的视野里，敌人如影随形，挥出了第三刀。整个院子陡然亮了几分。\n铸剑坊在三月来到了大暑，热浪升腾，连夜空都被蒸得泛起了白色。\n而他们的身后只有一棵老槐，退无可退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "别乱动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "这会儿还想抢剑？你想撞在那女人的刀上啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "没把孟铁衣的下落告诉我，去送死？个锤子的*尚蜀俚语*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "院落里突然多了个魁梧的汉子。\n以拳击刀背，护人，一气呵成。\n他像是一盆冷水泼地，逼得在场众人散开。\n暑气顿消。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你让我好找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "放开我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你差点没命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "让你在医馆养病，跑什么跑，伤又加重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "槐武痴，你竟然还在玉门城？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "哦，是你呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你师父要卸任后才肯和我痛痛快快分个胜负，我自然要在这里等他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "这三年你哪儿都没去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "哪儿都没去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "还能有什么比这件事重要？他要是离开了玉门，我要上哪儿再去找这么个对手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "你眼前就有另一位高手，你要是想找对手，不如先和她打一场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "你是说这个女人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "......碍事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我刚刚接了一刀，就觉得古怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "刀很重，但出招既没有形也没有意，我不清楚你这古怪的力量从何而来，但你绝不算什么高手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "我懒得和你打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "荆师傅，你听里面这动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个年轻人一言不合，破门而入，我压根来不及阻拦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "混账。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "铁衣大哥就剩这间工坊了，咱们平时受他那么多照顾，得帮忙护好喽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机警的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "先生，头儿，来了一些江湖人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机警的山海众成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "玉门守军也在后面，铸剑坊前街、苦井街、长门街三个方向，加起来估摸着有一个百人队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众首领",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_786_1",
      "text": "要找的人既然不在，何必在这儿浪费时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然的寂静。蝉鸣声仿佛从未响起。\n依然是三月，早春的寒意透衣而过，所有人都打了个冷颤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "山海众头目",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_793_1",
      "text": "撤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "附近的游侠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_797_1",
      "text": "荆师傅，就是他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "text": "这位官爷，往哪儿走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "让开！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "text": "你看看这满院狼藉，就剩几堵墙没拆了。连个说法都不给，哪有这样的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "玉门军方追查凶徒，妨碍者从重处置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "text": "等等，你是......左宣辽的儿子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荆先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_799_1",
      "text": "左宣辽他，就连这最后一间铸剑坊也不放过吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "放肆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "公子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "千夫长来的路上可有看到山海众？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "公子放心，已经分了人去追。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "好。将在场所有人悉数带回军营。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "公子，足足几十号人，都是城里的百姓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "这帮武人恰好在贼人撤离时出现，妨碍追凶，必须彻查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "其余人，或多或少都与此事有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "那个奇装异服的女孩事先就藏在铸剑坊，她一定知道孟铁衣的下落。你要是带走她，我也跟着一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "铸剑坊与山海众必有勾连，杜小姐与孟铁衣关系匪浅，本来也是要请你走一趟的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜遥夜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "至于这位姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "没得商量。她得跟我回去疗伤，然后还医药费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "别胡闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "我、我不能跟你回去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐姓男子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_785_1",
      "text": "哼，你不就是惦记那把剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "截云",
      "speakerId": "avg_4078_bdhkgt_1",
      "text": "你这个人——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_297_1",
      "text": "千夫长，将这些人带回军营详细审问，我去追宗师佩剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "千夫长",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_795_1",
      "text": "仇姑娘，你没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "小伤。先听左乐的，回军营。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇白",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_787_1",
      "text": "千夫长，这些江湖人士，还请不要太为难他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerId": "avg_243_waaifu_1",
      "text": "那个人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "铸剑坊方向传来嘈杂的声响，但槐琥停下了脚步。\n临街的屋檐上，掠过的人影已经消失，仿佛只是一阵风吹过。\n槐琥默默攥紧了拳头。\n她确信自己没有看错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
